ss=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-aad7154106d88822END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c999abada3ba55afEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_Oskar'sBeloved_OskarsBelovedMissingOskarReports</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Oskar%27sBeloved_OskarsBelovedMissingOskarReports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Oskar%27sBeloved_OskarsBelovedMissingOskarReports\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6b430f00-8194-4f40-8e5d-821ab434ac70</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6b430f00-8194-4f40-8e5d-821ab434ac70\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6b430f00-8194-4f40-8e5d-821ab434ac70\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a wooden desk <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-267&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-49</span> on the first floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A note written on official <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Flaming Fist</a> parchment.]\n</p><p><br>\nLady Jannath,\n</p><p>While I appreciate the offer of a generous donation to Fist coffers - I've got neither the authority nor spare boots on the ground to authorise a \"Sword Coast wide\" search of your friend, Mssr Fevras. I'll keep an eye out while I'm on the beat in the City, but until we get the full <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watch</a> rollout promised by the benevolent <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Lord Gortash</a>, we're simply stretched too thin. I hope he shows up soon, my lady, I really do.\n</p><p>All the best,\n</p><p>Devella Fountainhead\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715032802\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1609/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32372/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8699/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930819/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.857      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.857      1 -total\n 56.19%   25.203      7 Template:Icon_text\n 50.56%   22.681     17 Template:Trim\n 23.41%   10.502      2 Template:Uid\n 14.86%    6.666      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.89%    5.784      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.49%    5.603      2 Template:Icon_link\n  9.68%    4.341      1 Template:Notes\n  9.37%    4.203      7 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35702-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715032802 and revision id 365786. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}